  "id": "totem",
  "term": "totem",
  "definition": "Totem, here given as the North American (Algonkin) term otem, refers to a clan or kinship group. In this usage, it means a body of relatives larger than a household and smaller than a tribe, tracing descent through either the mother’s line or the father’s line, but not both.",
